# `tolower` and `toupper` use Unicode case mapping.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project l = tolower('ÄBC Straße'), u = toupper('äbc straße'), n = tolower(string(null))
---- expected
l          | u           | n
string     | string      | string
-----------+-------------+-------
äbc straße | ÄBC STRASSE | null
